- Acceleration / deceleration: unknown · no resolved capability-maintenance cadence in this export; overdue status is not reported
- Change of direction / multidirectional: unknown · no resolved capability-maintenance cadence in this export; overdue status is not reported
- Sport skill: unknown · no resolved capability-maintenance cadence in this export; overdue status is not reported
